00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.230 align:start position:0%
just days ago  kanye west delivered a freewheeling  political speech  surrounded by cameras one of america's  biggest music stars is trying to run for  u.s  president but his erratic statements  recently and  tweets since deleted has sparked  confusion and concern  now his wife kim kardashian west has  publicly addressed the issue on  instagram for the first time the reality  tv star said  he is a brilliant but complicated person  who on top of the pressures of being an  artist and a black man  who experienced the painful loss of his  mother  has to deal with the pressure and  isolation that is heightened by his  bipolar disorder  those who are close with kanye know his  heart and understand his words sometimes  do not align  with his intentions the mother of four  said she felt  compelled to speak up because of the  stigma and misconceptions about mental  health  last year her husband also spoke about  bipolar disorder  mental health advocates say well-known  stars  can help to raise public awareness i  think what  celebrities bring to this discussion is  that level of influence and the scope of  that influence that they can have  in the ways in which people often look  up to them as voices  and as artists it helps to reduce the  stigma  by demonstrating that it is something  that we can talk about that it's  something that's treatable  and that others who are experiencing  similar things are not alone  kanye west's presidential bid has  subjected him to  even more attention and scrutiny  his wife is asking instead for  compassion  and empathy cordelia lynch sky news  washington
 

